<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Seguimiento y Reportes - Aula Virtual</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 min-h-screen flex flex-col">

    <!-- Header / Navbar -->
    <header class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 sticky top-0 z-50 px-6 py-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <span class="bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 text-white p-2 rounded-lg font-bold text-lg shadow-md shadow-blue-200">AV</span>
                <h1 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Aula Virtual</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">Conectado como <strong class="text-slate-800 font-semibold">{{currentUser}}</strong></span>
                <a href="/dashboard" class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700 transition">Volver al Panel</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="flex-grow max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col space-y-8">
        
        <!-- ALUMNO VIEW: Boletín Académico -->
        {{#isAlumno}}
        <div class="flex flex-col space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 font-bold">Boletín Académico Oficial</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Consulta el estado de tus cursadas actuales, horarios de comisiones y las calificaciones oficiales cargadas por tus docentes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <!-- GPA Card -->
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-600 to-blue-600 rounded-2xl p-6 text-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-100 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-100">Promedio General</h3>
                    <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold mt-2">{{average}}</p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-indigo-200 mt-6 flex items-center">
                    <span>📈</span> <span class="ml-1">Calculado en base a materias evaluadas</span>
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Information Card -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between md:col-span-2">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-sm">Estado Académico</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2">Recuerda que para regularizar tus asignaturas necesitas un promedio mínimo de 4.00 y para promocionar debes alcanzar o superar 7.00. Ante cualquier duda, comunícate de forma privada con el docente de tu comisión.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-6 flex space-x-3">
                    <span class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">Regular: &ge; 4</span>
                    <span class="bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">Promocionado: &ge; 7</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Grades Table -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
            <div class="p-5 border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Detalle por Asignatura</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto p-5">
                <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs">
                    <thead>
                        <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
                            <th class="pb-3 font-semibold">Materia</th>
                            <th class="pb-3 font-semibold">Comisión / Horario</th>
                            <th class="pb-3 font-semibold">Condición</th>
                            <th class="pb-3 font-semibold">Nota</th>
                            <th class="pb-3 font-semibold text-right">Fecha de Carga</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
                        {{#reports}}
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/40 transition">
                            <td class="py-4">
                                <span class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 text-[9px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase mr-2">{{materia_codigo}}</span>
                                <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">{{materia_nombre}}</span>
                            </td>
                            <td class="py-4 text-slate-500 font-medium">
                                {{horario}}
                            </td>
                            <td class="py-4">
                                {{#is_aprobado}}
                                <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800">
                                    🟢 Aprobado
                                </span>
                                {{/is_aprobado}}
                                {{#is_regular}}
                                <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-100 text-blue-800">
                                    🔵 Regular (R) - Debe final
                                </span>
                                {{/is_regular}}
                                {{#is_pendiente}}
                                <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-100 text-slate-800">
                                    ⚪ Cursando
                                </span>
                                {{/is_pendiente}}
                            </td>
                            <td class="py-4 font-bold text-sm">
                                {{#nota}}
                                <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700">
                                    {{nota}}
                                </span>
                                {{/nota}}
                                {{^nota}}
                                <span class="text-slate-400 font-normal">-</span>
                                {{/nota}}
                            </td>
                            <td class="py-4 text-right text-slate-400 font-medium">
                                {{#fecha_nota}}{{fecha_nota}}{{/fecha_nota}}
                                {{^fecha_nota}}-{{/fecha_nota}}
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        {{/reports}}
                        {{^reports}}
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="4" class="text-center text-slate-400 py-12">No te encuentras inscrito en ninguna materia todavía.</td>
                        </tr>
                        {{/reports}}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
        {{/isAlumno}}

        <!-- DIRECTIVOS / ADMIN VIEW: Dashboard Académico Ejecutivo -->
        {{#isAdminReport}}
        <div class="flex flex-col space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 font-bold">Rendimiento Educativo Institucional</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Dashboard ejecutivo y estadístico para directores y administradores. Analiza e inspecciona el desempeño escolar global.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- KPI Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm flex items-center space-x-4">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">
                    👥
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-slate-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Alumnos Matriculados</h3>
                    <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 mt-1">{{totalStudents}}</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm flex items-center space-x-4">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">
                    👨‍🏫
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-slate-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Cuerpo Docente</h3>
                    <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 mt-1">{{totalTeachers}}</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm flex items-center space-x-4">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-50 text-green-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">
                    📈
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-slate-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Nota Promedio General</h3>
                    <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 mt-1">{{schoolAverage}}</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            <!-- Table: Performance per subject -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
                <div class="p-5 border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Rendimiento Promedio por Asignatura</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="p-5">
                    <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs">
                        <thead>
                            <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
                                <th class="pb-3 font-semibold">Materia</th>
                                <th class="pb-3 font-semibold text-center">Promedio</th>
                                <th class="pb-3 font-semibold text-right">Evaluaciones</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
                            {{#subjectStats}}
                            <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/40 transition">
                                <td class="py-3">
                                    <span class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 text-[9px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded uppercase mr-1">{{materia_codigo}}</span>
                                    <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">{{materia_nombre}}</span>
                                </td>
                                <td class="py-3 text-center font-extrabold text-indigo-600">
                                    {{avg_nota}}
                                </td>
                                <td class="py-3 text-right text-slate-400 font-medium">
                                    {{total_graded}}
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            {{/subjectStats}}
                            {{^subjectStats}}
                            <tr>
                                <td colspan="3" class="text-center text-slate-400 py-6">Aún no se han registrado evaluaciones escolares.</td>
                            </tr>
                            {{/subjectStats}}
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Table: Matriculation per commission -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
                <div class="p-5 border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Nivel de Matriculación por Comisión</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="p-5">
                    <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs">
                        <thead>
                            <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
                                <th class="pb-3 font-semibold">Comisión / Horario</th>
                                <th class="pb-3 font-semibold text-right">Alumnos Inscritos</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
                            {{#commissionStats}}
                            <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/40 transition">
                                <td class="py-3">
                                    <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 block">{{materia_nombre}}</span>
                                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">🕒 {{horario}}</span>
                                </td>
                                <td class="py-3 text-right font-extrabold text-slate-900">
                                    {{total_enrolled}}
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            {{/commissionStats}}
                            {{^commissionStats}}
                            <tr>
                                <td colspan="2" class="text-center text-slate-400 py-6">No hay comisiones planificadas en el sistema.</td>
                            </tr>
                            {{/commissionStats}}
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        {{/isAdminReport}}

    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-white border-t border-slate-200 py-6 px-6 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
        <p>&copy; 2026 Aula Virtual - Trabajo Integrador IS2.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
